From: shawn.guo@linaro.org (Shawn Guo)
Date: Fri, 11 May 2018 10:50:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: defconfig: sync it with savedefconfig
Message-ID: <1526007049-27884-1-git-send-email-shawn.guo@linaro.org>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

Sync the defconfig with savedefconfig with the following commands:

 make defconfig
 make savedefconfig
 cp defconfig arch/arm64/configs/defconfig

Signed-off-by: Shawn Guo <shawn.guo@linaro.org>
